WEBVTT

00:09:59.011 --> 00:10:00.596
in the small screen?

00:10:01.263 --> 00:10:03.515
And it's not a pretty sight.

00:10:03.557 --> 00:10:05.851
AI is not yet self-aware.

00:10:06.852 --> 00:10:12.483
But we are becoming more self-aware
as we work with AI

00:10:12.483 --> 00:10:16.654
and we realize that Homo sapiens
is no longer fit for purpose.

00:10:16.654 --> 00:10:17.946
We need a reboot.

00:10:17.946 --> 00:10:19.490
So what are we going to choose?

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:23.285
Apocalypse or an alternative?

00:10:23.327 --> 00:10:27.623
I believe that humans
have a strong future as a hybrid species

00:10:27.665 --> 00:10:31.669
as we start to merge
with the biotechnology we're creating,